usinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1586137/7fe1c258-0c38-4db7-8d27-b255b6cca4e4.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1586137/7fe1c258-0c38-4db7-8d27-b255b6cca4e4.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Spacious Apartment in Peaceful Brandenburg Region 🌳🏡\nApartment Features 🛋️🍽️🌟\nWelcome to a cozy and well-equipped apartment in Nauen, designed for a comfortable and hassle-free stay. This one-bedroom apartment features a fully functional kitchen with modern appliances, including a dishwasher and oven, perfect for preparing meals during your stay. Relax in the living area with a flat-screen TV and a comfy seating arrangement. The bathroom is fitted with a shower and comes with fresh towels and linens for your convenience.\n\nPrime Location & Accessibility 🚉🌳🛤️\nSituated in the serene village of Groß Behnitz, this property is ideal for those seeking tranquility while staying well-connected. Public transport is available just 2.2 km away at the Groß Behnitz train station. Explore the nearby attractions like the stunning Sanssouci Palace (40 km) or enjoy the bustling city life in Berlin, located 44 km away.\n\nNeighborhood Highlights 🍴☕🏞️\nDelight in local culinary experiences with the Seeterrassen restaurant just 400 meters away or venture a bit further to Café Monet, 5 km from the property. The area combines natural beauty with accessibility, providing an idyllic escape from city life while keeping essential amenities close by.\n\nAdditional Notes ✨🌿📍\nThe apartment is part of a peaceful property featuring a shared garden and a terrace, ideal for enjoying quiet mornings or relaxed evenings. Free WiFi and private parking are included to ensure a seamless experience.\n\n💬 Send a message now to make this delightful apartment your home away from home in Brandenburg! 🌟\n\n","facilities":{"airC